<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06017003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
If rear wheel house outer extension is to be replaced partially, install new rear wheel house outer extension to vehicle body and cut in stacked condition.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install rear wheel house outer extension to vehicle body.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
If rear wheel house outer extension is to be replaced partially, conduct continuous weld and apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of continuous weld part.
</ptxt>
